{"id":"7145c12676268ab1","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-second-incompleteness.md","title":"Gödel's Second Incompleteness Theorem","display":"thm-second-incompleteness — Gödel's Second Incompleteness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-second-incompleteness","aliases":["90-thm-second-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-second-incompleteness — Gödel's Second Incompleteness Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-provable]]","[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","[[90-df-hbl-conditions]]","[[90-lem-lob]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-second-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-second-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-second-incompleteness — Gödel's Second Incompleteness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9aca87310232fb2f\" href=\"?note=9aca87310232fb2f\" title=\"89-df-hilbert-bernays\">89-df-hilbert-bernays</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8d9c15743f7342d2\" href=\"?note=8d9c15743f7342d2\" title=\"90-df-hbl-conditions\">90-df-hbl-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f9a3c4a1ebd2b711\" href=\"?note=f9a3c4a1ebd2b711\" title=\"90-lem-lob\">90-lem-lob</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,d,T\">\\(S,g,d,T\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的环境；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}},\\mathrm{Con}_T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}},\\mathrm{Con}_T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 取原依赖文件，且全部使用同一实际证明呈示。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原有外部引用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9aca87310232fb2f\" href=\"?note=9aca87310232fb2f\" title=\"89-df-hilbert-bernays\">89-df-hilbert-bernays</a> 未随输入提供，予以保留，不补造该文件。按原文对它的说明，本条目的二元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)\\)</span> 明确解释为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8d9c15743f7342d2\" href=\"?note=8d9c15743f7342d2\" title=\"90-df-hbl-conditions\">90-df-hbl-conditions</a> 的三个模式，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P)\\)</span>；不假定该外部文件还提供其它结论。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HB}(T,P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{HBL}_T(P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\mathrm{DiagAdeq}_{S,g,d}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span>，则由其定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\bot)})\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\bot)})\\)</span>，纯逻辑给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\bot)})\\to\\bot\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\bot)})\\to\\bot\\)</span>。以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bot\">\\(A=\\bot\\)</span> 应用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f9a3c4a1ebd2b711\" href=\"?note=f9a3c4a1ebd2b711\" title=\"90-lem-lob\">90-lem-lob</a>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\bot\">\\(T\\vdash\\bot\\)</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span> 矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{HB}(T,\\mathrm{Prov}_T)\\)</span> 接口、外部依赖名称及定理前件；本地展开避免读者必须猜测该引用提供哪三条条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span> 中的可证性公式不得与 HBL 条件中的公式更换。有效公理化或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span> 不单独推出三个内部推导模式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-diagonal-lemma","status":"resolved","id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-hilbert-bernays","status":"resolved","id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-hilbert-bernays]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-hbl-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8d9c1574